{"5321820":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Liani","steam_appid":5321820,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321820\/extras\/991689a71fd41b786f9c51bc4ddc781a.avif?t=1793724954\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321820\/extras_big\/991689a71fd41b786f9c51bc4ddc781a.webp?t=1793724954 width=1560 height=280 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who is Liani?<\/strong><br><strong>Where is Liani?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey that begins on a planet you don't know, there is only one path ahead of you: Go up.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liani is a 3D parkour and platformer game that demands skill, timing, and focus.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you climb, try to clear one circular platform after another. With every platform you pass, the difficulty of the course increases. Use your reflexes to get past obstacles, jump at just the right moment, and control your movements carefully.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide How to Use Your Points<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the gold found on the platforms along the course and earn points. Every 10 gold you collect rewards you with 1 diamond.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't think of your diamonds as just a score. You will use them as an important resource that affects your progress in the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you've collected enough diamonds, you can unlock the locked area and access it from the menu.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, when you fail on the course, you can spend 5 diamonds to continue from where you left off. So you'll need to decide when to spend your diamonds: Will you use them to keep moving forward, or save them to unlock the locked area?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Is at the End of the Journey?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal here is to find the way out. However, discovering what the game is hiding and where the journey leads is up to you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of Liani:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill- and timing-based 3D parkour gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour difficulty that increases as you progress<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circular platforms and a variety of obstacles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible gold and a diamond system<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game system where you can use your points strategically<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A locked area that can be unlocked with diamonds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric and minimalist visual world<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321820\/extras\/991689a71fd41b786f9c51bc4ddc781a.avif?t=1793724954\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321820\/extras_big\/991689a71fd41b786f9c51bc4ddc781a.webp?t=1793724954 width=1560 height=280 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who is Liani?<\/strong><br><strong>Where is Liani?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey that begins on a planet you don't know, there is only one path ahead of you: Go up.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liani is a 3D parkour and platformer game that demands skill, timing, and focus.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you climb, try to clear one circular platform after another. With every platform you pass, the difficulty of the course increases. Use your reflexes to get past obstacles, jump at just the right moment, and control your movements carefully.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide How to Use Your Points<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the gold found on the platforms along the course and earn points. Every 10 gold you collect rewards you with 1 diamond.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't think of your diamonds as just a score. You will use them as an important resource that affects your progress in the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you've collected enough diamonds, you can unlock the locked area and access it from the menu.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, when you fail on the course, you can spend 5 diamonds to continue from where you left off. So you'll need to decide when to spend your diamonds: Will you use them to keep moving forward, or save them to unlock the locked area?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Is at the End of the Journey?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal here is to find the way out. However, discovering what the game is hiding and where the journey leads is up to you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of Liani:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill- and timing-based 3D parkour gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour difficulty that increases as you progress<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circular platforms and a variety of obstacles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible gold and a diamond system<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game system where you can use your points strategically<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A locked area that can be unlocked with diamonds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric and minimalist visual world<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Who is Liani? Where is Liani? Every obstacle will test you. Every step will lead you into the unknown. Remember, all you have to do to keep moving forward is to never give up.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321820\/bb803403416f248b128abe7799a89472fb0f318b\/header.jpg?t=1793724954","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321820\/0faecdca4d8111ffed1104988a0c52d4eefda4a7\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793724954","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321820\/0faecdca4d8111ffed1104988a0c52d4eefda4a7\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793724954","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 730<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-2120<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 740<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Ayrionis"],"publishers":["Ayrionis"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":209,"final":209,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"2,09€"},"packages":[1839087],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Liani","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1839087,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Liani 